    "profile_text": {
        "body": "AeroVironment Inc describes itself as a manufacturer of Unmanned Aircraft Systems, Unmanned Aerial Vehicles, Loitering Munition Systems, and Unmanned Ground Vehicles used for surveillance and reconnaissance by the United States Military, U.S. allies, and Commercial Industries. The company also says it manufactures High-Altitude Pseudo-Satellites.\n\nIts MacCready Works group is described as an advanced development group inspired by Dr. Paul B. MacCready, Jr., with engineers, roboticists, and AI researchers designing next-generation robotic systems across air, land, and sea. The company says the group follows the MacCready Method: build fast, test relentlessly, deploy advantage.\n\nAeroVironment Inc is a public company headquartered in Arlington, Virginia, trading under ticker AVAV, with CIK number 0001368622. Legal exposure records show 152 matters in Virginia. No individual court cases are listed.",
